include LICENSE
include README.md
include AGENTS.md
include pyproject.toml
include data/README.md
include plan/*.md
recursive-include tools *.py

# ── sdist 自足性（用户下载源码包后能直接跑它自带的测试与真值自检）──
# 只收 conftest.py 等测试源码，不收表格；data/fixtures 只收真值（*.json/*.md），
# 表格本体（table.csv）永不入包 —— 隐私红线。
# 显式列后缀，禁止写成 `recursive-include examples *`，
# 否则会把本机 examples/adult/adult.csv（3.4 MB UCI Adult）打进 sdist。
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include data/fixtures *.json *.md
recursive-include examples *.py *.json *.md *.sh
